# Testing

## Backend (pytest)

- Default: mocked service-layer tests in `backend/tests/unit/`
- HTTP contract smokes in `backend/tests/api/` (status / envelope / 401 / 403). Empty `tests/service/` — do not add.
- Env: `TEST_DATABASE_URL` for `db_session` and L1 seed; `alembic -x test=true` after migration pauses. Unit tests still mock; `db_session` skips if the URL is unset. Seed refuses a DB name without `test`.
- Run: `pipenv run pytest tests/unit/ tests/api/` (from `backend/`)

## Frontend (Vitest + Testing Library)

- Colocate: `*.test.ts(x)` next to source
- Run: `npm test` (from `frontend/`)

## When to write tests

- ✅ New services/hooks, validation, bug fixes (regression)
- ❌ Styling-only changes

`backend/scripts/seed_test_data.py` upserts L1 user + workspace + membership (fixed UUIDs) on `TEST_DATABASE_URL` only. Do not copy product-domain seed scripts.
